# Biome check (not typecheck)

After you change JS/TS/JSON/CSS in this repo, from the workspace root run Biome on **those files only**:

```
bun biome check --write -- path/to/changed.ts path/to/other.tsx
```

Then run a full `bun biome check` (no `--write` on the whole tree unless you intend to format everything). Fix remaining diagnostics in files you touched until that scoped check is clean.

Do **not** run `bun run typecheck`, `tsc --noEmit`, or package `typecheck` scripts as a post-edit check unless the user explicitly asked for typecheck.

`typecheck` stays in app build/release scripts. Agent verification is Biome.
Do not run `bun biome check --write` with no paths: it can reformat the whole included tree.
